c points at 240, 720 and 1,920 px; the label boxes are the model's, not painted text.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"gaps\": {\n      \"line\": \"Generated label sets are checked only in Node, against the layout with a fixed-width test measurer, not as painted text in a browser. The 200 % condition doubles the page's inherited font size; the browser's own text-only zoom is not run. The late font is checked at 480 and 1,280 px only, without text spacing or the 200 % condition. No line chart with an unordered category x is drawn in these tests, so middle truncation, the full text in tooltip and table, and the hidden-labels note with AX143 are not exercised on this type.\",\n      \"area\": \"Generated label sets are checked only in Node, against the layout with a fixed-width test measurer, not as painted text in a browser. The 200 % condition doubles the page's inherited font size; the browser's own text-only zoom is not run. The late font is checked at 480 and 1,280 px only, without text spacing or the 200 % condition. No area chart with an unordered category x is drawn in these tests, so middle truncation, the full text in tooltip and table, and the hidden-labels note with AX143 are not exercised on this type.\",\n      \"bar\": \"Generated label sets are checked only in Node, against the layout with a fixed-width test measurer, not as painted text in a browser. The 200 % condition doubles the page's inherited font size; the browser's own text-only zoom is not run. The late font is checked at 480 and 1,280 px only, without text spacing or the 200 % condition. The twelve-label browser test accepts either middle truncation or the note, so neither path is forced in a browser: the note and AX143 are checked only through the controller (Node). The full text of a truncated label is checked in the table only if the browser truncates one, and never in the tooltip.\",\n      \"scatter\": \"Generated label sets are checked only in Node, against the layout with a fixed-width test measurer, not as painted text in a browser. The 200 % condition doubles the page's inherited font size; the browser's own text-only zoom is not run. The late font is checked at 480 and 1,280 px only, without text spacing or the 200 % condition.\",\n      \"donut\": \"No generated label sets: the slice labels are one fixed set, and the layout property test has no text for a ring. The 200 % condition doubles the page's inherited font size; the browser's own text-only zoom is not run. The late font is checked at 480 and 1,280 px only, without text spacing or the 200 % condition.\"\n    },\n    \"limits\": {\n      \"line\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. The 200 % condition sets <body> to 28 px; text the chart sizes in fixed pixels does not grow with it. The layout property test drives the layout directly, with a test measurer of 7 px per character.\",\n      \"area\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. The 200 % condition sets <body> to 28 px; text the chart sizes in fixed pixels does not grow with it. The layout property test drives the layout directly, with a test measurer of 7 px per character.\",\n      \"bar\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. The 200 % condition sets <body> to 28 px; text the chart sizes in fixed pixels does not grow with it. The layout property test drives the layout directly, with a test measurer of 7 px per character. Orientation is checked on the bar chart only, by the bars keeping one width at every container width.\",\n      \"scatter\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. The 200 % condition sets <body> to 28 px; text the chart sizes in fixed pixels does not grow with it. The layout property test drives the layout directly, with a test m