 excluding author domain\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"property\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/f-domains.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"F1 compact: for any generated signed bar data the value domain and drawn baseline include zero, even with an excluding author domain\",\n          \"registration\": \"F1 ${type}: for any generated signed ${kind} data the value domain and drawn baseline include zero, even with an excluding author domain\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/f-domains.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"F1 compact: area draws the 82 to 97 fixture from zero and reads the actual values\",\n          \"registration\": \"F1 ${type}: ${kind} draws the 82 to 97 fixture from zero and reads the actual values\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/f-domains.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"F1 compact: bar draws the 82 to 97 fixture from zero and reads the actual values\",\n          \"registration\": \"F1 ${type}: ${kind} draws the 82 to 97 fixture from zero and reads the actual values\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/compact.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"C2 compact area: the value axis includes zero (F1): for the Phase 1 bars values (82–97) each datum is drawn at value / 97 of the height above the bottom\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/compact.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"C2 compact bar: the value axis includes zero (F1): for the Phase 1 bars values (82–97) each datum is drawn at value / 97 of the height above the bottom\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"limits\": {\n      \"area\": \"Node evidence: the committed value domain, the AX110 code and the lower edge of the area in the scene; generated values run from -100 to 100, so all-negative, mixed-sign and all-positive data occur.\",\n      \"bar\": \"Node evidence: the committed value domain, the AX110 code and each bar's baseline in the scene; generated values run from -100 to 100. Only vertical bars are run, no horizontal bar chart.\",\n      \"compact\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. F1 reaches compact area and compact bar (a compact line is not under F1); both are run in Node and drawn in Chrome, where each datum's height above the baseline is compared with value / 97. The author-domain case (widening and AX110) is checked in Node only.\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"F2\",\n    \"statement\": \"Missing values are never drawn as zero and never bridged unless the author asks: an explicit null is a gap, silently; a value isolated between two gaps is a visible point; a missing bar shows a \\\"no data\\\" mark at the baseline, distinct from a zero bar; on a time or date axis with a regular step an absent step is a gap and raises AX105; missing: 'zero' turns absent and null values into zeros for counts; tooltip, table and announcements say \\\"No data\\\".\",\n    \"appliesTo\": [\n      \"line\",\n      \"area\",\n      \"bar\",\n      \"scatter\",\n      \"donut\",\n      \"compact\"\n    ],\n    \"notApplicable\": {},\n    \"evidence\": {\n      \"line\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/f-missing-values.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"F2 line: line distinguishes null, absent field, absent date and zero in geometry and reader text\",\n          \"registration\": \"F2 ${type}: ${kind} distinguishes null, absent field, absent date and zero in geometry and reader text\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/f-missing-values.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"F2 line: line missing zero makes the requested count gaps ordinary zero values\",\n          \"registration\": \"F2 ${type}: ${kind} missing zero makes the requested count gaps ordinary zero values\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"property\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/f-missing-values.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"F2 line: for any generated missing index no stroke or fill run bridges it\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/f-missing-values.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"F2 line: an isolated value between two gaps is drawn at its coordinates below 12 px spacing\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/f-missing-values.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"F2 line: deleted daily rows and explicit nulls leave the same seven-day break\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"property\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/f-missing-values.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"F2 line: a generated absent daily step and the same explicit null produce the same gap\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/f2-gaps.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"F2 line: null values are gaps, never zero and never bridged, and the value isolated between two gaps is a visible point\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/f2-gaps.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"F2 line: on a regular date axis, explicit nulls and the same rows deleted render the same gap, and the deleted rows raise AX105\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/f2-gaps.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"F2 line: with missing: 'zero' on the field, an explicit n