exes are asserted on this type for AX102, AX103 and AX106 only.\",\n      \"scatter\": \"AX141 is checked on scatter only as the code Chrome raises after the background changes. AX142 is checked in Chrome for its level and the fallback, not its delivery. AX143 has no scatter check. AX199 is checked on scatter only as the code a throwing x getter raises (unit test) and, without its code, as the internal-failure state shown in Chrome. A tick formatter that throws is checked only for raising AX160, not for its level, delivery, fallback text or the absent note. The AX107 test checks the summary's count, not the note. Delivery not checked on this type: errors printing in a production build, and two charts on one page printing a code once (the delivery module's unit test only; line in a development build); hints staying silent in a production build (line only); under strict, an error found on create or append (only update is checked), a hint not throwing, and late findings other than AX160 not throwing. Field and row indexes are asserted on this type for AX102, AX103 and AX106 only.\",\n      \"donut\": \"AX141 is checked on donut only as the code Chrome raises after the background changes. AX142 is checked in Chrome for its level and the fallback, not its delivery. AX199 is checked on donut only as the internal-failure state shown in Chrome, without its code. Delivery not checked on this type: errors printing in a production build, and two charts on one page printing a code once (the delivery module's unit test only; line in a development build); hints staying silent in a production build (line only); under strict, an error found on create or append (only update is checked), a hint not throwing, and late findings other than AX160 not throwing. Field and row indexes are asserted on this type for AX102, AX103 and AX106 only.\",\n      \"compact\": \"AX141 is checked for compact line only, as the code Chrome raises after the background changes. AX132 (compact bar with more 