\",\n          \"title\": \"A4 donut: View as table opens an HTML table built from the data: title as caption, field labels with units as column headers, x values as row headers, values formatted as in F6\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a4-table.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A4 donut: the table sits in a focusable scroll region named by its caption, no taller than the plot, and opening it does not move another chart on the page\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a4-table.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A4 donut: on a page of 24 charts, opening one chart's table moves none of the other 23\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a4-table.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A4 donut: 250 rows are shown 100 per page; Next and Previous page reach every row; jumping to an x value shows the page that holds it\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a4-table.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A4 donut: a \\\"Jump to\\\" value that matches no row is identified, described in visible text and associated with the field (reading: WCAG 3.3.1 applies to the jump field)\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"gaps\": {\n      \"area\": \"A value near row 900,000 of 1,000,000 is reached by jumping on line only; on this type paging and jumping are shown on 250 rows.\",\n      \"bar\": \"A value near row 900,000 of 1,000,000 is reached by jumping on line only; on this type paging and jumping are shown on 250 rows.\",\n      \"scatter\": \"A value near row 900,000 of 1,000,000 is reached by jumping on line only; on this type paging and jumping are shown on 250 rows.\",\n      \"donut\": \"A value near row 900,000 of 1,000,000 is reached by jumping on line only; on this type paging and jumping are shown on 250 rows.\"\n    },\n    \"limits\": {\n      \"line\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. The table is read from Chrome's accessibility tree. Fixture values are whole numbers and dates; the million-row test reads one fractional value (123.25), so F6's fraction rules are otherwise not exercised in the table.\",\n      \"area\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. The table is read from Chrome's accessibility tree. Fixture values are whole numbers and dates, so F6's fraction rules are not exercised in the table.\",\n      \"bar\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. The table is read from Chrome's accessibility tree. Fixture values are whole numbers and dates, so F6's fraction rules are not exercised in the table.\",\n      \"scatter\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. The table is read from Chrome's accessibility tree. Fixture values are whole numbers and dates, so F6's fraction rules are not exercised in the table.\",\n      \"donut\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. The table is read from Chrome's accessibility tree. Fixture values are whole numbers and dates, so F6's fraction rules are not exercised in the table. A donut has no zoom, so the current-range part does not arise.\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"A5\",\n    \"statement\": \"Series are never distinguished by colour alone, in any mode. Each line and area carries a shape marker at its last point and at sparse intervals, repeated in the legend and tooltip; under prefers-contrast: more or forced colours, lines also differ by dash. Adjacent filled marks (slices, stacked segments) are separated by at least 1 px of background. Bars are told apart by position and order and by the legend and tooltip that name them; in a compact chart, which has neither, neighbouring bar series also differ by fill pattern (four patterns exist). The default palette has eight colours, each at least 3:1 on the default light and dark backgrounds, with a minimum pairwise OKLab difference of 0.10 under normal vision and simulated protanopia, deuteranopia and tritanopia; on any other background AX141 is raised below 3:1.\",\n    \"appliesTo\": [\n      \"line\",\n      \"area\",\n      \"bar\",\n      \"scatter\",\n      \"donut\",\n      \"compact\"\n    ],\n    \"notApplicable\": {},\n    \"evidence\": {\n      \"line\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/reader-model.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 line: two drawn series have different marker shapes and contrast dashes with their series bindings\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 line: each of three dense series carries a shape marker at its last point and at sparse intervals; the shapes differ by series and are repeated in the legend and the tooltip\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 line: under prefers-contrast: more three lines differ by dash, pairwise\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 line: under forced-colors: active three lines differ by dash, pairwise\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 line: the eight painted colours (light scheme) are each at least 3:1 on their painted backdrop and at least 0.10 apart in OKLab under normal vision and simulated protanopia, deuteranopia and tritanopia, analytic and as an 8-bit image\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 line: the eight painted colours (dark scheme) are each at least 3:1 on their painted backdrop and at least 0.10 apart in OKLab under normal vision and simulated protanopia, deuteranopia and tritanopia, analytic and as an 8-bit image\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 line: on a background the palette does not suit (the first series' painted colour itself), AX141 is raised\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 line: in grayscale, each of three crossing traces' last-point marker has the shape class of its legend marker and differs from the other two by shape class (whether a reader can follow the crossing lines remains a human judgement)\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"area\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/reader-model.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 area: two drawn series have different marker shapes and contrast dashes with their series bindings\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 area: each of three dense series carries a shape marker at its last point and at sparse intervals; the shapes differ by series and are repeated in the legend and the tooltip\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 area: under prefers-contrast: more three lines differ by dash, pairwise\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 area: under forced-colors: active three lines differ by dash, pairwise\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 area: stacked areas are separated by at least 1 px of background, measured across the boundary (reading: stacked areas are stacked segments)\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 area: the eight painted colours (light scheme) are each at least 3:1 on their painted backdrop and at least 0.10 apart in OKLab under normal vision and simulated protanopia, deuteranopia and tritanopia, analytic and as an 8-bit image\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 area: the eight painted colours (dark scheme) are each at least 3:1 on their painted backdrop and at least 0.10 apart in OKLab under normal vision and simulated protanopia, deuteranopia and tritanopia, analytic and as an 8-bit image\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 area: on a background the palette does not suit (the first series' painted colour itself), AX141 is raised\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"bar\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/reader-model.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 bar: adjacent stacked bars leave one pixel for the background while preserving the outer total\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 bar: stacked segments are separated by at least 1 px of background in every stack: geometry, and painted pixels against a 1 px control\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 bar: grouped bars of different series are separated by at least 1 px of background: geometry, and painted pixels against a 1 px control\",\n          \"registration\": \"A5 bar: grouped bars of different series are separated by at least 1 px of background${horizontal ? ' (horizontal bars)' : ''}: geometry, and painted pixels against a 1 px control\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 bar: grouped bars of different series are separated by at least 1 px of background (horizontal bars): geometry, and painted pixels against a 1 px control\",\n          \"registration\": \"A5 bar: grouped bars of different series are separated by at least 1 px of background${horizontal ? ' (horizontal bars)' : ''}: geometry, and painted pixels against a 1 px control\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/type-matrix.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"T-tooltip-bar: every visible series at that category, in series order; a hidden series is not listed\",\n          \"registration\": \"T-tooltip-${type}: every visible series at that ${type === 'bar' ? 'category' : 'x'}${type === 'area' ? ' and, stacked, the stack total' : ''}, in series order; a hidden series is not listed\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 bar: the eight painted colours (light scheme) are each at least 3:1 on their painted backdrop and at least 0.10 apart in OKLab under normal vision and simulated protanopia, deuteranopia and tritanopia, analytic and as an 8-bit image\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 bar: the eight painted colours (dark scheme) are each at least 3:1 on their painted backdrop and at least 0.10 apart in OKLab under normal vision and simulated protanopia, deuteranopia and tritanopia, analytic and as an 8-bit image\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 bar: on a background the palette does not suit (the first series' painted colour itself), AX141 is raised\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"scatter\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/reader-model.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 scatter: separate series have distinct marker shapes as well as paint bindings\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 scatter: each series is drawn with its own point shape, repeated in the legend and in the tooltip of each point\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 scatter: the eight painted colours (light scheme) are each at least 3:1 on their painted backdrop and at least 0.10 apart in OKLab under normal vision and simulated protanopia, deuteranopia and tritanopia, analytic and as an 8-bit image\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 scatter: the eight painted colours (dark scheme) are each at least 3:1 on their painted backdrop and at least 0.10 apart in OKLab under normal vision and simulated protanopia, deuteranopia and tritanopia, analytic and as an 8-bit image\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 scatter: on a background the palette does not suit (the first series' painted colour itself), AX141 is raised\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"donut\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/reader-model.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 donut: adjacent slices carry a background separator in the scene handed to the renderer\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 donut: each of the four seams of the ring, the closing one at 12 o'clock included, is at least 1 px of background against a 1 px control at the same angle\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 donut: the eight painted colours (light scheme) are each at least 3:1 on their painted backdrop and at least 0.10 apart in OKLab under normal vision and simulated protanopia, deuteranopia and tritanopia, analytic and as an 8-bit image\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 donut: the eight painted colours (dark scheme) are each at least 3:1 on their painted backdrop and at least 0.10 apart in OKLab under normal vision and simulated protanopia, deuteranopia and tritanopia, analytic and as an 8-bit image\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 donut: on a background the palette does not suit (the first series' painted colour itself), AX141 is raised\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"compact\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/reader-model.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 compact: when there is no legend two series remain distinguishable by dash with their paint bindings\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 compact: two compact series differ by dash as well as colour, with no legend to tell them apart\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/compact.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"C4 compact area: two series differ by dash as well as colour, and AX131 suggests one series per compact chart\",\n          \"registration\": \"C4 compact ${kind}: two series differ by ${kind === 'bar' ? 'more than colour, as painted (reading: A5 asks a non-colour cue of bars too)' : 'dash as well as colour'}, and AX131 suggests one series per compact chart\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/compact.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"C4 compact bar: two series differ by more than colour, as painted (reading: A5 asks a non-colour cue of bars too), and AX131 suggests one series per compact chart\",\n          \"registration\": \"C4 compact ${kind}: two series differ by ${kind === 'bar' ? 'more than colour, as painted (reading: A5 asks a non-colour cue of bars too)' : 'dash as well as colour'}, and AX131 suggests one series per compact chart\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 compact: under prefers-contrast: more three lines differ by dash, pairwise\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 compact: under forced-colors: active three lines differ by dash, pairwise\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 compact: the eight painted colours (light scheme) are each at least 3:1 on their painted backdrop and at least 0.10 apart in OKLab under normal vision and simulated protanopia, deuteranopia and tritanopia, analytic and as an 8-bit image\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 compact: the eight painted colours (dark scheme) are each at least 3:1 on their painted backdrop and at least 0.10 apart in OKLab under normal vision and simulated protanopia, deuteranopia and tritanopia, analytic and as an 8-bit image\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 compact: on a background the palette does not suit (the first series' painted colour itself), AX141 is raised\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"gaps\": {\n      \"bar\": \"No test asserts that the bars within a group are drawn in the order in which the legend and the tooltip list the series: the tooltip test asserts the names and their order, and the separator tests the distinct positions.\",\n      \"compact\": \"Compact area and compact bar are not checked under prefers-contrast: more or forced colours, and the palette scores and AX141 run on compact line only. No test measures separators between adjacent filled marks in a stacked compact area or bar. The fill-pattern check uses two series, so the rule for series further apart (four patterns) is not exercised.\"\n    },\n    \"limits\": {\n      \"line\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. Markers are found in the SVG and their shapes compared with the legend and tooltip swatches; dashes are computed styles; palette colours are sampled from painted marks against the painted backdrop, with the colour-vision deficiencies simulated analytically and on an 8-bit image; AX141 is checked on one background, the first series' own colour. Whether a reader can follow three crossing lines in grayscale is a human judgement; the test compares marker shape classes.\",\n      \"area\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. Markers are found in the SVG and their shapes compared with the legend and tooltip swatches; dashes are computed styles; the separator is measured on painted pixels against a 1 px control gap; palette colours are sampled from painted marks against the painted backdrop, with the colour-vision deficiencies simulated analytically and on an 8-bit image; AX141 is