      \"title\": \"dark: 1. every series color reaches 3:1 on the default background\",\n          \"registration\": \"${name}: 1. every series color reaches 3:1 on the default background\",\n          \"reason\": \"Palette tokens only: every default series colour is at least 3:1 on the default dark background; nothing is painted, and compact area and bar marks are not measured.\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"gaps\": {\n      \"line\": \"Only the text shown at rest is measured: the tooltip, the readout strip, the opened table, the notes and the state messages are not (axe-core covers some of them, in the light scheme only). No L2 fixture has a reference label, the text Axylo can draw over a mark or a band, so text drawn inside a mark is not checked.\",\n      \"area\": \"Only the text shown at rest is measured: the tooltip, the readout strip, the opened table, the notes and the state messages are not (axe-core covers some of them, in the light scheme only). No L2 fixture has a reference label, the text Axylo can draw over a mark or a band, so text drawn inside a mark is not checked.\",\n      \"bar\": \"Only the text shown at rest is measured: the tooltip, the readout strip, the opened table, the notes and the state messages are not (axe-core covers some of them, in the light scheme only). No L2 fixture has a reference label, the text Axylo can draw over a mark or a band, so text drawn inside a mark is not checked.\",\n      \"scatter\": \"Only the text shown at rest is measured: the tooltip, the readout strip, the opened table, the notes and the state messages are not (axe-core covers some of them, in the light scheme only). No L2 fixture has a reference label, the text Axylo can draw over a mark or a band, so text drawn inside a mark is not checked.\",\n      \"donut\": \"Only the text shown at rest is measured: the tooltip, the readout strip, the opened table, the notes and the state messages are not (axe-core covers some of them, in the light scheme only).\",\n      \"compact\": \"Only a compact line is painted; compact area and bar marks are not measured. The test does not require any text on a compact chart, and the state messages, the text a compact chart can show, are not measured.\"\n    },\n    \"limits\": {\n      \"line\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. Text contrast pairs the computed text colour with the most frequent painted colour in the text's box; marks, axis lines and the focus ring are sampled from screenshots at device pixel ratio 2. The dark scheme is a page that sets color-scheme: dark and a dark background.\",\n      \"area\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. Text contrast pairs the computed text colour with the most frequent painted colour in the text's box; marks, axis lines and the focus ring are sampled from screenshots at device pixel ratio 2. The dark scheme is a page that sets color-scheme: dark and a dark background.\",\n      \"bar\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. Text contrast pairs the computed text colour with the most frequent painted colour in the text's box; marks, axis lines and the focus ring are sampled from screenshots at device pixel ratio 2. The dark scheme is a page that sets color-scheme: dark and a dark background.\",\n      \"scatter\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. Text contrast pairs the computed text colour with the most frequent painted colour in the text's box; marks, axis lines and the focus ring are sampled from screenshots at device pixel ratio 2. The dark scheme is a page that sets color-scheme: dark and a dark background.\",\n      \"donut\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. Text contrast pairs the computed text colour with the most frequent painted colour in the text's box; marks, axis lines and the focus ring are sampled from screenshots at device pixel ratio 2. The dark scheme is a page that sets color-scheme: dark and a dark background.\",\n      \"compact\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. Marks are sampled from screenshots at device pixel ratio 2; a compact chart has no axis lines or focus ring. The dark scheme is a page that sets color-scheme: dark and a dark background.\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"L7\",\n    \"statement\": \"Empty data shows a message inside the plot area; so do loading, error and Axylo's own internal failures. No invented axis ranges, no blank box. A change of state is announced once, politely.\",\n    \"appliesTo\": [\n      \"line\",\n      \"area\",\n      \"bar\",\n      \"scatter\",\n      \"donut\",\n      \"compact\"\n    ],\n    \"notApplicable\": {},\n    \"evidence\": {\n      \"line\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/l-legibility.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"L7 line: empty data shows its message inside the plot and in the accessibility tree, with no tick labels and no invented axis\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/l-legibility.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"L7 line: loading, an author error and an internal failure each show their exact message inside the plot with no axes; each change of state is announced exactly once, politely, and nothing else is\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/reader-model.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"L7 line: loading, empty and error draw no data marks and each state change is announced once\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"