n 3.6.\",\n      \"compact\": \"Section 3.7: a compact chart has no tooltip, and C1 gives it no pointer-only behaviour.\"\n    },\n    \"evidence\": {\n      \"donut\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/type-matrix.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"T-pointer-donut donut: picks clockwise by arc; the hole and outside of the ring yield no slice\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/type-matrix.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"T-pointer-donut: the slice under the pointer is picked; the hole and the outside pick nothing\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"limits\": {\n      \"donut\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. The browser points at each of the four slices at its middle angle and 85% of the outer radius, at the centre of the hole and outside the ring.\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"T-pointer-scatter\",\n    \"statement\": \"Picking by pointer · Nearest point within 24 px; ties go to the later row\",\n    \"appliesTo\": [\n      \"scatter\"\n    ],\n    \"notApplicable\": {\n      \"line\": \"This is the scatter cell of section 3.6.\",\n      \"area\": \"This is the scatter cell of section 3.6.\",\n      \"bar\": \"This is the scatter cell of section 3.6.\",\n      \"donut\": \"This is the scatter cell of section 3.6.\",\n      \"compact\": \"Section 3.7: a compact chart has no tooltip, and C1 gives it no pointer-only behaviour.\"\n    },\n    \"evidence\": {\n      \"scatter\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/type-matrix.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"T-pointer-scatter scatter: picks the nearest point within 24 CSS pixels and breaks a distance tie by later caller row\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/