zoom-bar). Pinch goes through CDP touch events.\",\n      \"scatter\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. The four ways and the wheel run on a numeric x; only the x range is read. Pinch goes through CDP touch events.\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"T-zoom-line\",\n    \"statement\": \"Zoom · On time, date and numeric x only (no category zoom in 1.0)\",\n    \"appliesTo\": [\n      \"line\"\n    ],\n    \"notApplicable\": {\n      \"area\": \"This is the line cell of section 3.6.\",\n      \"bar\": \"This is the line cell of section 3.6.\",\n      \"scatter\": \"This is the line cell of section 3.6.\",\n      \"donut\": \"This is the line cell of section 3.6.\",\n      \"compact\": \"Section 3.7: a compact chart has no zoom.\"\n    },\n    \"evidence\": {\n      \"line\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/type-matrix.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"T-zoom-line: zoom applies: controls are offered and + narrows the x range\",\n          \"registration\": \"T-zoom-${type}: ${type === 'scatter' ? 'x only in 1.0: + narrows the x range, controls are offered, and the y axis keeps the full data range though the visible y extremes change' : 'zoom applies: controls are offered and + narrows the x range'}\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/i1-pointer.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"I3 line: from the keyboard, each of +, Shift+Right, Shift+Left, - and 0 has its own effect, checked after each key\",\n          \"registration\": \"I3 ${cell(type)}${type === 'bar (date)' ? ' (date axis)' : type === 'bar' ? ' (number axis)' : ''}: from the keyboard, each of +, Shift+Right, Shift+Left, - and 0 has its own effect, checked after each key\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axyl