om.\"\n    },\n    \"evidence\": {\n      \"area\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/type-matrix.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"T-zoom-area: zoom applies: controls are offered and + narrows the x range\",\n          \"registration\": \"T-zoom-${type}: ${type === 'scatter' ? 'x only in 1.0: + narrows the x range, controls are offered, and the y axis keeps the full data range though the visible y extremes change' : 'zoom applies: controls are offered and + narrows the x range'}\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/i1-pointer.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"I3 area: from the keyboard, each of +, Shift+Right, Shift+Left, - and 0 has its own effect, checked after each key\",\n          \"registration\": \"I3 ${cell(type)}${type === 'bar (date)' ? ' (date axis)' : type === 'bar' ? ' (number axis)' : ''}: from the keyboard, each of +, Shift+Right, Shift+Left, - and 0 has its own effect, checked after each key\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/type-matrix.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"T-zoom-area area: numeric, time and calendar-date fields support zoom on x and Reset restores all observations\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/chart/interaction.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"category bar, line and area charts have no zoom controls; a donut has none (1.0: no category zoom)\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/core/snapshot.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"area: zoom(['B', 'C']) is a no-op reported as AX150; marks, ticks, lookup and controls unchanged\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"gaps\": {\n      \"area\": \"On a time x an area is zoomed only through the Node 