e's description, the plot's value text and the table are compared before and after three paused appends; after Resume the table holds every buffered row once, with its values.\",\n      \"scatter\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. With the table open over the plot, the scene's markup, the figure's description, the plot's value text and the table are compared before and after three paused appends; after Resume the table holds every buffered row once, with its values.\",\n      \"donut\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. With the table open over the plot, the scene's markup, the figure's description, the plot's value text and the table are compared before and after three paused appends; after Resume the table holds every buffered row once, with its values.\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"I5\",\n    \"statement\": \"First render is not animated. An update may transition for at most 200 ms. Under prefers-reduced-motion: reduce nothing transitions, on first render or on update.\",\n    \"appliesTo\": [\n      \"line\",\n      \"area\",\n      \"bar\",\n      \"scatter\",\n      \"donut\",\n      \"compact\"\n    ],\n    \"notApplicable\": {},\n    \"evidence\": {\n      \"line\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/i1-pointer.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"I5 line: first render is not animated (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference): from the first painted frame, frame by frame for 2.5 s, the marks' markup and computed paint never change and no animation runs on the chart; a screenshot taken with animations running matches the one at 2.5 s\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/i1-pointer.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"I5 line: first render is 