me for 2.5 s, the marks' markup and computed paint never change and no animation runs on the chart; a screenshot taken with animations running matches the one at 2.5 s\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/i1-pointer.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"I5 donut: first render is not animated (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce): from the first painted frame, frame by frame for 2.5 s, the marks' markup and computed paint never change and no animation runs on the chart; a screenshot taken with animations running matches the one at 2.5 s\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/i1-pointer.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"I5 donut: an update shows the new data and settles within 200 ms of the call, on the page's clock; under reduced motion its first frame is already the final one, with no animation\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/i1-pointer.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"I5 donut: a filter change across 24 charts on one page settles within 200 ms of the change, on the page's clock\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"compact\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/i1-pointer.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"I5 compact: first render is not animated (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference): from the first painted frame, frame by frame for 2.5 s, the marks' markup and computed paint never change and no animation runs on the chart; a screenshot taken with animations running matches the one at 2.5 s\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/i1-pointer.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"I5 compact: first render is not animated (prefers-reduced-m