e scatter cell in section 3.6.\",\n      \"area\": \"This is the scatter cell in section 3.6.\",\n      \"bar\": \"This is the scatter cell in section 3.6.\",\n      \"donut\": \"This is the scatter cell in section 3.6.\",\n      \"compact\": \"Section 3.6 is the matrix of the five full chart types; a compact chart draws no reference lines or bands (F7, section 3.7).\"\n    },\n    \"evidence\": {\n      \"scatter\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/type-matrix.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"T-reference-scatter scatter: a line and band extend the appropriate domains, bind to reference paint and are listed in summary and caption\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/type-matrix.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"T-reference-scatter: a reference line outside the data is included in the domain, painted at its position in the reference colour, labelled next to its own mark, and listed in the summary and the table caption\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/type-matrix.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"T-reference-scatter: a reference band outside the data is included in the domain, painted at its position in the reference colour, labelled next to its own mark, and listed in the summary and the table caption\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"limits\": {\n      \"scatter\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. A y line and an x band are drawn; a y band and an x line are not drawn on a scatter chart.\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"L5\",\n    \"statement\": \"A marker on every point appears only when adjacent points are at least 12 px apart (provisional value), and always for isolated points.\",\n    \"appliesTo\": [\n      \"line\",\n      \"area\