ce: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. The page checks read the built documentation site; its build (apps/docs/lib/site.mjs, run before those tests) refuses broken links and duplicate ids, so a broken link fails their setup.\",\n      \"compact\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. The page checks read the built documentation site; its build (apps/docs/lib/site.mjs, run before those tests) refuses broken links and duplicate ids, so a broken link fails their setup. The compact test runs compact line, area and bar.\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"DX5\",\n    \"statement\": \"update changes options, append adds rows and zoom sets the view, applied in call order; validation and diagnostics are synchronous, drawing waits for the next frame, and marks, labels, hit testing and the accessibility layer switch together; destroy() releases everything and cancels pending work; there is no resize().\",\n    \"appliesTo\": [\n      \"line\",\n      \"area\",\n      \"bar\",\n      \"scatter\",\n      \"donut\",\n      \"compact\"\n    ],\n    \"notApplicable\": {},\n    \"evidence\": {\n      \"line\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/dx-controller.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"DX5 line: replace then append then zoom in one turn switches marks, text and lookup together\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/dx-controller.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"DX5 line: a present patch key replaces the whole field, undefined restores the default, and absent keys stay\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/dx-controller.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"DX5 line: strict create, update and append reject warnings synchronously and keep the last valid c