ent (spec DX5, \\\"Verified by\\\"); the benchmark harness in bench/ exists, and the acceptance measurements wait for a quiet machine (STATUS.md, 2026-11-18).\",\n      \"scatter\": \"Not measured yet: the heap trend over 1,000 create–destroy cycles is P7's measurement (spec DX5, \\\"Verified by\\\"); the benchmark harness in bench/ exists, and the acceptance measurements wait for a quiet machine (STATUS.md, 2026-11-18).\",\n      \"donut\": \"Not measured yet: the heap trend over 1,000 create–destroy cycles is P7's measurement (spec DX5, \\\"Verified by\\\"); the benchmark harness in bench/ exists, and the acceptance measurements wait for a quiet machine (STATUS.md, 2026-11-18).\",\n      \"compact\": \"Not measured yet: the heap trend over 1,000 create–destroy cycles is P7's measurement (spec DX5, \\\"Verified by\\\"); the benchmark harness in bench/ exists, and the acceptance measurements wait for a quiet machine (STATUS.md, 2026-11-18).\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"DX6\",\n    \"statement\": \"Colors, font and spacing are CSS custom properties with documented names; the chart inherits font-family and color; colors pins a color to a series name so it is the same on every chart; there is no theme object and no positional palette option.\",\n    \"appliesTo\": [\n      \"line\",\n      \"area\",\n      \"bar\",\n      \"scatter\",\n      \"donut\",\n      \"compact\"\n    ],\n    \"notApplicable\": {},\n    \"evidence\": {\n      \"line\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/dx-controller.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"DX6 line: a named color reaches the theme by series key as other entries change\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"apps/docs/test/theming.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"every custom property in the stylesheet is documented\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"apps/docs/test/theming.test.ts\"