rectly, with a test measurer of 7 px per character.\",\n      \"donut\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. The 200 % condition sets <body> to 28 px; text the chart sizes in fixed pixels does not grow with it.\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"C4\",\n    \"statement\": \"With more than one series, compact lines differ by dash as well as colour, since there is no legend; AX131 suggests one series per compact chart.\",\n    \"appliesTo\": [\n      \"compact\"\n    ],\n    \"notApplicable\": {\n      \"line\": \"Spec 3.7 states C4 for the compact variant only (compact: true); a compact line chart is counted in the compact column.\",\n      \"area\": \"Spec 3.7 states C4 for the compact variant only (compact: true); a compact area chart is counted in the compact column.\",\n      \"bar\": \"Spec 3.7 states C4 for the compact variant only (compact: true); a compact bar chart is counted in the compact column.\",\n      \"scatter\": \"Spec 2.1 and 3.7 define a compact variant for line, area and bar only; scatter has none.\",\n      \"donut\": \"Spec 2.1 and 3.7 define a compact variant for line, area and bar only; donut has none.\"\n    },\n    \"evidence\": {\n      \"compact\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/compact.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"C4 compact: two line strokes use distinct paint bindings and dashes and AX131 suggests one series\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/compact.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"C4 compact: two area strokes use distinct paint bindings and dashes and AX131 suggests one series\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/dx-diagnostics.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"F3 compact: AX131 keeps both series and gives them different dashes\",\n          \"registration\": \"F3 ${type}: ${test.code} ${test.name}\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/compact.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"C4 compact line: two series differ by dash as well as colour, and AX131 suggests one series per compact chart\",\n          \"registration\": \"C4 compact ${kind}: two series differ by ${kind === 'bar' ? 'more than colour, as painted (reading: A5 asks a non-colour cue of bars too)' : 'dash as well as colour'}, and AX131 suggests one series per compact chart\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/compact.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"C4 compact area: two series differ by dash as well as colour, and AX131 suggests one series per compact chart\",\n          \"registration\": \"C4 compact ${kind}: two series differ by ${kind === 'bar' ? 'more than colour, as painted (reading: A5 asks a non-colour cue of bars too)' : 'dash as well as colour'}, and AX131 suggests one series per compact chart\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/compact.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"C4 compact bar: two series differ by more than colour, as painted (reading: A5 asks a non-colour cue of bars too), and AX131 suggests one series per compact chart\",\n          \"registration\": \"C4 compact ${kind}: two series differ by ${kind === 'bar' ? 'more than colour, as painted (reading: A5 asks a non-colour cue of bars too)' : 'dash as well as colour'}, and AX131 suggests one series per compact chart\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"weak\": {\n      \"compact\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a5-not-colour-alone.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A5 compact: the eight painted colours (light scheme) are