ve part reads the positive total and the negative total in the tooltip, never their net, and the parts sit on their own sides of zero\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"limits\": {\n      \"area\": \"Browser evidence: system Chrome, SVG renderer (the default); no Firefox or WebKit result is recorded yet. The browser reads a stacked two-series area, then one with a positive and a negative part, whose total gives both signed totals (F10).\"\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"T-tooltip-bar\",\n    \"statement\": \"Tooltip content · Every series in that category\",\n    \"appliesTo\": [\n      \"bar\"\n    ],\n    \"notApplicable\": {\n      \"line\": \"This is the bar cell of section 3.6.\",\n      \"area\": \"This is the bar cell of section 3.6.\",\n      \"scatter\": \"This is the bar cell of section 3.6.\",\n      \"donut\": \"This is the bar cell of section 3.6.\",\n      \"compact\": \"Section 3.7: a compact chart has no tooltip.\"\n    },\n    \"evidence\": {\n      \"bar\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"unit\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/acceptance/type-matrix.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"T-tooltip-bar bar: lists visible series in order and distinguishes No observation from No data\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/type-matrix.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"T-tooltip-bar: every visible series at that category, in series order; a hidden series is not listed\",\n          \"registration\": \"T-tooltip-${type}: every visible series at that ${type === 'bar' ? 'category' : 'x'}${type === 'area' ? ' and, stacked, the stack total' : ''}, in series order; a hidden series is not listed\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/type-matrix.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"T-tooltip-bar: on horizontal bars too, every series in the category under the pointer\"\n