ines and the focus indicator'} are painted at least 3:1\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"compact\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/l-legibility.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"L2 compact: in the light scheme every text is at least 12 CSS px and 4.5:1 on what is painted behind it (legend entries of hidden series included); marks are painted at least 3:1\",\n          \"registration\": \"L2 ${type}: in the ${scheme} scheme every text is at least 12 CSS px and 4.5:1 on what is painted behind it (legend entries of hidden series included); marks${type === 'compact' ? '' : ', axis lines and the focus indicator'} are painted at least 3:1\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/l-legibility.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"L2 compact: in the dark scheme every text is at least 12 CSS px and 4.5:1 on what is painted behind it (legend entries of hidden series included); marks are painted at least 3:1\",\n          \"registration\": \"L2 ${type}: in the ${scheme} scheme every text is at least 12 CSS px and 4.5:1 on what is painted behind it (legend entries of hidden series included); marks${type === 'compact' ? '' : ', axis lines and the focus indicator'} are painted at least 3:1\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    \"weak\": {\n      \"line\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/a11y/axe.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"trend: default, table open, tooltip shown, series hidden\",\n          \"reason\": \"axe-core's default rules, colour contrast among them, report no violation for the trend fixture at rest, with the tooltip shown, a series hidden and the table open, in the light scheme only; the test does not require the contrast rule to have decided, and text size is not checked.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"area\": [\n        {\