owser/acceptance/a6-a10.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A8 line: axe-core reports no violations on the whole landmarked page in every state (line: default, keyboard focus with tooltip, pointer tooltip, table open, streaming, paused, zoomed, a series hidden, loading, empty, error, and with values left out), each state checked to hold before the scan\",\n          \"registration\": \"A8 ${type.startsWith('compact') ? 'compact' : type}: axe-core reports no violations on the whole landmarked page in every state (${type}: ${states(type).map(s => s.name).join(', ')}, and with values left out), each state checked to hold before the scan\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"browser\",\n          \"file\": \"packages/axylo/test/browser/acceptance/a6-a10.browser.test.ts\",\n          \"title\": \"A8 line: with a 250-row table open, its scroll region scrolls and axe-core decides scrollable-region-focusable with no violation\"\n        }\n      ],\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
